  m_text: "\r\nMY THERAPY NOTES\r\n\r\nYou've completed everything on the list, yet
    it keeps coming back. \nSometimes, even when a task is finished, the feeling
    that something is wrong doesn't go away.\r\n\r\nYou've already done what needed
    to be done. \nThe feeling of uncertainty might still be there, but that doesn't
    mean you have to start again. Maybe it's time to leave.\r\n\n\n\r\nClick anywhere
    to close.\r\n  "
